WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.916 --> 00:00:30.666
In the previous verse,

2
00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:32.250
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:33.500
described the glory of the divine

4
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.666
knowledge of bhakti-yoga.

5
00:00:35.666 --> 00:00:38.250
In this verse, He says that

6
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.250
shraddha – faith – is essential

7
00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.083
for progress on this path.

8
00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:43.500
Without faith,

9
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.750
even the simple

10
00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:47.875
and joyful path of devotion
 begins to feel difficult.

11
00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:50.666
And a person who lacks faith

12
00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:51.791
remains

13
00:00:51.791 --> 00:00:54.833
trapped in the cycle of birth and death.

14
00:00:54.833 --> 00:00:58.500
Let us understand this verse more deeply.

15
00:01:03.583 --> 00:01:07.625
What is the importance of faith in human life?

16
00:01:07.625 --> 00:01:08.541
In this verse,

17
00:01:08.541 --> 00:01:11.083
Lord Krishna answers this question.

18
00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:13.500
He speaks about those

19
00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:14.625
who lack

20
00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:17.083
faith and trust in devotion.

21
00:01:17.083 --> 00:01:19.458
Lord Krishna clearly says –

22
00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:22.041
those who have no shraddha in devotion

23
00:01:22.041 --> 00:01:23.541
can never

24
00:01:23.541 --> 00:01:25.583
establish a connection with Me.

25
00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:28.916
Without faith, even the simple, natural,

26
00:01:28.916 --> 00:01:30.750
and joyful path of devotion

27
00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:33.625
begins to feel burdensome. 
And they remain trapped

28
00:01:33.625 --> 00:01:37.291
in the endless cycle of birth and death.

29
00:01:37.291 --> 00:01:40.166
It is just like having

30
00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:43.250
a perfect medicine in hand,
 but refusing to take it

31
00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:45.208
because you do not believe

32
00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:48.916
it will work. And as a result,

33
00:01:48.916 --> 00:01:51.083
instead of getting better,

34
00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:52.541
your condition only worsens.

35
00:01:52.541 --> 00:01:57.166
In the same way, without faith,
 devotion loses all its value.

36
00:01:57.166 --> 00:01:59.125
But note this carefully –

37
00:01:59.125 --> 00:02:02.500
faith does not mean blind belief.

38
00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:05.708
It means trusting that

39
00:02:05.708 --> 00:02:07.041
through service to Lord Krishna,

40
00:02:07.041 --> 00:02:10.166
we can receive supreme joy.

41
00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:12.666
When we chant His name

42
00:02:12.666 --> 00:02:14.541
or listen to His divine pastimes,

43
00:02:14.541 --> 00:02:16.250
peace and happiness

44
00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:18.916
naturally arise in the mind.

45
00:02:18.916 --> 00:02:20.666
But today,

46
00:02:20.666 --> 00:02:23.250
some people doubt devotion

47
00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:25.375
or consider it unnecessary.

48
00:02:25.375 --> 00:02:26.541
This mindset keeps them away

49
00:02:26.541 --> 00:02:28.166
from the divine experience

50
00:02:28.166 --> 00:02:29.375
of bhakti.

51
00:02:29.375 --> 00:02:30.291
And so

52
00:02:30.291 --> 00:02:31.916
they remain caught

53
00:02:31.916 --> 00:02:33.583
in the struggles of material life.

54
00:02:33.583 --> 00:02:35.333
Lord Krishna says –

55
00:02:35.333 --> 00:02:37.708
shraddha is the first step of devotion.

56
00:02:37.708 --> 00:02:41.625
It is natural to have questions or feel uncertain.

57
00:02:41.625 --> 00:02:43.583
Even Arjuna had many questions.

58
00:02:43.583 --> 00:02:47.541
But he never doubted Lord Krishna.

59
00:02:47.541 --> 00:02:48.500
In the same way,

60
00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:49.250
we too

61
00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:52.000
should not doubt the path of devotion –

62
00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:52.666
Because,

63
00:02:52.666 --> 00:02:53.875
this is the path

64
00:02:53.875 --> 00:02:54.875
that will bring us

65
00:02:54.875 --> 00:02:56.875
closer to Lord Krishna.

66
00:02:56.875 --> 00:03:00.000
Whether it is chanting His name,

67
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.583
reading the Gita,

68
00:03:01.583 --> 00:03:03.541
or spending time with spiritual people –

69
00:03:03.541 --> 00:03:05.291
continuing these practices

70
00:03:05.291 --> 00:03:11.041
over time it will only deepen
 your faith in devotion,

71
00:03:11.041 --> 00:03:14.125
and all doubts will fade away.

72
00:03:14.125 --> 00:03:15.666
Faith does not mean

73
00:03:15.666 --> 00:03:18.583
you must understand everything at once.

74
00:03:18.583 --> 00:03:21.375
Faith means trying this path

75
00:03:21.375 --> 00:03:24.083
with an open mind.

76
00:03:24.083 --> 00:03:25.333
And that very effort

77
00:03:25.333 --> 00:03:27.833
will give us the experience of Lord Krishna.

78
00:03:27.833 --> 00:03:28.833
Our faith

79
00:03:28.833 --> 00:03:30.625
in devotion

80
00:03:30.625 --> 00:03:33.291
will free us from the cycle of birth and death

81
00:03:33.291 --> 00:03:37.125
and open the path to lasting joy.

82
00:03:37.125 --> 00:03:41.541
Therefore, place your faith
 in the teachings of Lord Krishna

83
00:03:41.541 --> 00:03:45.625
and make your life easy and simple.

84
00:03:50.583 --> 00:03:54.416
To achieve success in life,

85
00:03:54.416 --> 00:03:58.750
it is essential to have faith in yourself.

86
00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:02.083
Without it, the path to your goals

87
00:04:02.083 --> 00:04:05.375
will begin to feel difficult.

88
00:04:05.375 --> 00:04:08.250
You may be wondering –

89
00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.500
why do I say this?

90
00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:14.708
Look, When you doubt yourself

91
00:04:14.708 --> 00:04:18.583
or stop believing in your own abilities,

92
00:04:18.583 --> 00:04:22.583
you sink into a kind of quicksand –

93
00:04:22.583 --> 00:04:25.375
where every struggle

94
00:04:25.375 --> 00:04:29.125
pulls you deeper down.

95
00:04:29.125 --> 00:04:32.500
I told Arjuna the same thing –

96
00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.375
faith is

97
00:04:34.375 --> 00:04:39.000
the key to every success, whether it is devotion,

98
00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.333
personal growth, or

99
00:04:41.333 --> 00:04:45.000
any other area of life.

100
00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:48.208
Without faith, every path feels hard –

101
00:04:48.208 --> 00:04:50.791
whether it is the path of devotion

102
00:04:50.791 --> 00:04:52.500
or the path toward your goals.

103
00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:56.000
Let us understand this with an example.

104
00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.250
Imagine you have

105
00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:02.375
a treasure map. But

106
00:05:02.375 --> 00:05:05.083
you doubt

107
00:05:05.083 --> 00:05:08.583
whether the treasure is actually there.

108
00:05:08.583 --> 00:05:11.500
If that doubt stops you from

109
00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:14.916
ever following the map,

110
00:05:14.916 --> 00:05:19.375
the treasure will always remain out of reach.

111
00:05:19.375 --> 00:05:22.833
In the same way, if you do
 not believe in your own abilities

112
00:05:22.833 --> 00:05:27.041
or in the guidance you have received,

113
00:05:27.041 --> 00:05:30.291
you will begin to doubt yourself,

114
00:05:30.291 --> 00:05:34.458
get stuck in a cycle of inaction,

115
00:05:34.458 --> 00:05:38.250
and never move forward.

116
00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:42.125
Remember – faith does not mean

117
00:05:42.125 --> 00:05:46.750
you must have all the answers right away.

118
00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:48.208
It means

119
00:05:48.208 --> 00:05:49.791
continuing to try

120
00:05:49.791 --> 00:05:52.333
even in the presence of uncertainty.

121
00:05:52.333 --> 00:05:54.583
Just as devotion deepens

122
00:05:54.583 --> 00:05:58.041
your connection with Me,

123
00:05:58.041 --> 00:06:01.541
when you believe in yourself

124
00:06:01.541 --> 00:06:04.750
and move forward with firm resolve,

125
00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:07.916
the doors of growth and success

126
00:06:07.916 --> 00:06:10.000
begin to open on their own.

127
00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:13.416
If you wish to be free from unnecessary struggle

128
00:06:13.416 --> 00:06:18.458
and find lasting joy and success,

129
00:06:18.458 --> 00:06:21.041
keep faith and trust –

130
00:06:21.041 --> 00:06:22.916
both in your spiritual life

131
00:06:22.916 --> 00:06:24.750
and in your personal life.

132
00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:28.708
Success and happiness will surely come.

133
00:06:33.625 --> 00:06:38.625
Just as a garden that is tended
 with care blooms

134
00:06:38.625 --> 00:06:41.958
with beautiful flowers over time –

135
00:06:41.958 --> 00:06:43.750
a family that is rooted in faith and trust

136
00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:48.625
finds happiness and peace.

137
00:06:48.625 --> 00:06:53.333
But if a garden is not watered,

138
00:06:53.333 --> 00:06:58.208
can it remain beautiful?

139
00:06:58.208 --> 00:07:00.500
No. Just as a garden withers

140
00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:03.625
without water,

141
00:07:03.625 --> 00:07:05.541
Similarly,

142
00:07:05.541 --> 00:07:07.416
when a family lacks faith

143
00:07:07.416 --> 00:07:09.666
and trust,

144
00:07:09.666 --> 00:07:14.041
differences and doubts take root –

145
00:07:14.041 --> 00:07:17.125
and relationships begin to break.

146
00:07:17.125 --> 00:07:19.708
Just as a beautiful melody falls apart

147
00:07:19.708 --> 00:07:23.875
when one note is missing,

148
00:07:23.875 --> 00:07:26.083
Similarly,

149
00:07:26.083 --> 00:07:29.041
distrust and doubt bring resentment

150
00:07:29.041 --> 00:07:33.166
and conflict into relationships.

151
00:07:33.166 --> 00:07:35.208
And you begin to question

152
00:07:35.208 --> 00:07:38.958
each other’s ability to work together.

153
00:07:38.958 --> 00:07:40.083
Faith within a family

154
00:07:40.083 --> 00:07:44.041
is not just an exchange of words.

155
00:07:44.041 --> 00:07:45.708
It is an unshakeable

156
00:07:45.708 --> 00:07:47.791
belief in the goodness hidden deep

157
00:07:47.791 --> 00:07:50.791
within each other’s souls.

158
00:07:50.791 --> 00:07:52.791
When family members face any

159
00:07:52.791 --> 00:07:55.791
problem together,

160
00:07:55.791 --> 00:07:58.333
even differences transform

161
00:07:58.333 --> 00:08:01.708
into growth and mutual understanding.

162
00:08:01.708 --> 00:08:03.291
Remember –

163
00:08:03.291 --> 00:08:07.041
when the light of trust shines,

164
00:08:07.041 --> 00:08:11.666
the family moves forward
 together on the path of progress.

165
00:08:11.666 --> 00:08:13.458
Just as devotion frees you

166
00:08:13.458 --> 00:08:16.625
from the struggles of material life,

167
00:08:16.625 --> 00:08:19.541
faith within a family

168
00:08:19.541 --> 00:08:22.208
becomes a strength –

169
00:08:22.208 --> 00:08:26.333
one that brings not only trust and joy, but

170
00:08:26.333 --> 00:08:29.791
also becomes a source

171
00:08:29.791 --> 00:08:31.791
of energy and inspiration.

172
00:08:36.708 --> 00:08:41.708
why believing in your
 organisation’s purpose matters –

173
00:08:41.708 --> 00:08:43.500
and how genuine faith

174
00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:46.375
in it can lead you

175
00:08:46.375 --> 00:08:49.416
to success?

176
00:08:49.416 --> 00:08:52.791
Have you ever thought about it?

177
00:08:52.791 --> 00:08:54.416
Remember –

178
00:08:54.416 --> 00:08:58.166
your faith and trust in
 your workplace’s purpose is

179
00:08:58.166 --> 00:09:00.000
that unique force

180
00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.208
which gives your work momentum.

181
00:09:03.208 --> 00:09:07.166
You do your work wholeheartedly.

182
00:09:07.166 --> 00:09:08.541
But when you begin to doubt

183
00:09:08.541 --> 00:09:12.500
your organisation’s purpose,

184
00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:15.750
your work becomes mechanical,

185
00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.666
colourless, and unsatisfying.

186
00:09:18.666 --> 00:09:20.708
I told Arjuna –

187
00:09:20.708 --> 00:09:22.375
without faith, a person

188
00:09:22.375 --> 00:09:26.541
remains trapped in a cycle of struggle.

189
00:09:26.541 --> 00:09:29.666
In the same way, if you do
not have full belief

190
00:09:29.666 --> 00:09:32.333
in your organisation’s purpose,

191
00:09:32.333 --> 00:09:36.625
your contribution will lack meaning –

192
00:09:36.625 --> 00:09:39.458
and you too will get stuck

193
00:09:39.458 --> 00:09:42.500
in that same cycle.

194
00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:45.416
Remember – faith in your
 organisation’s purpose

195
00:09:45.416 --> 00:09:49.291
is not blind belief.

196
00:09:49.291 --> 00:09:52.416
It is the ability to see

197
00:09:52.416 --> 00:09:54.125
that your work

198
00:09:54.125 --> 00:09:56.791
is connected to something greater.

199
00:09:56.791 --> 00:09:59.666
When you believe in that purpose,

200
00:09:59.666 --> 00:10:05.208
you bring enthusiasm and energy to your work.

201
00:10:05.208 --> 00:10:09.041
This faith not only benefits the organisation,

202
00:10:09.041 --> 00:10:10.083
but also

203
00:10:10.083 --> 00:10:13.250
encourages your own personal growth –

204
00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:17.041
making your efforts meaningful

205
00:10:17.041 --> 00:10:19.333
and fruitful.

206
00:10:19.333 --> 00:10:21.166
Just as devotion to Me

207
00:10:21.166 --> 00:10:24.625
frees a person from material bondage,

208
00:10:24.625 --> 00:10:28.250
faith in your workplace’s purpose

209
00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:31.208
gives you fresh energy –

210
00:10:31.208 --> 00:10:34.041
helping you produce powerful results

211
00:10:34.041 --> 00:10:37.041
in your work.

212
00:10:37.041 --> 00:10:42.083
So trust in your organisation’s vision,

213
00:10:42.083 --> 00:10:46.958
align your efforts with that purpose,
 and you will find

214
00:10:46.958 --> 00:10:51.708
that not just the organisation, but you yourself

215
00:10:51.708 --> 00:10:55.166
are moving toward progress and success.
